  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Commencement of development (Full Permission)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development to which\r\nthis permission relates shall be commenced not later than the expiration of 3\r\nyears from the date of this permission.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  To comply with Section 91\r\n(as amended) of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Approved Plans</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans: [</span></span>N/01,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/02,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/07,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/08,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/09,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/10,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/11,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/12,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/13,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N/14,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">N]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">External Materials as Specified</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The facing materials to be used for the\r\ndevelopment hereby permitted shall be those specified in the application form\r\nunless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure a satisfactory\r\nappearance of the development and to comply with the following Development Plan\r\npolicies for Merton: policies D4 and D8 of the London Plan 2021, policies D12.1\r\nand D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.</span><s></s></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Removal of PD (Windows/Doors)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - Notwithstanding the provisions of the\r\nTown and Country Planning (General Permitted Development)(England) Order 2015\r\n(or any order revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without\r\nmodification), no window, door or other opening other than those expressly\r\nauthorised by this permission shall be constructed in (officer to insert\r\nrelevant elevations) without planning permission first being obtained from the\r\nLocal Planning Authority.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To safeguard the\r\namenities and privacy of the occupiers of nearby properties and to comply with\r\nthe following Development Plan policies for Merton: policy D4 of the London\r\nPlan 2021 and policies D12.3 & D12.4</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\" aptos\",sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;=\"\" mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\">of the Local Plan 2024.  </span></span></p>"
